{"id":"7419fb5f5a6ad5df","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-addition-function.md","title":"Addition Function","display":"df-addition-function — Addition Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-addition-function","aliases":["57-df-addition-function"],"display":"df-addition-function — Addition Function","depends_on":["[[57-df-natural-number]]","[[57-df-successor-function]]","[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-addition-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-addition-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-addition-function — Addition Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa2f7d42f23bb3d7\" href=\"?note=aa2f7d42f23bb3d7\" title=\"57-df-natural-number\">57-df-natural-number</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b2a81ec25c112645\" href=\"?note=b2a81ec25c112645\" title=\"57-df-successor-function\">57-df-successor-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}_2\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a>。自然数加法使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"aa2f7d42f23bb3d7\" href=\"?note=aa2f7d42f23bb3d7\" title=\"57-df-natural-number\">57-df-natural-number</a> 的背景算术。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{add}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\mathrm{add}(a,0)\\coloneqq a,\\qquad\\mathrm{add}(a,b+1)\\coloneqq S(\\mathrm{add}(a,b)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{add}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\mathrm{add}(a,0)\\coloneqq a,\\qquad\\mathrm{add}(a,b+1)\\coloneqq S(\\mathrm{add}(a,b)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{add}(a,b)=a+b,\\qquad\\mathrm{add}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{add}(a,b)=a+b,\\qquad\\mathrm{add}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-natural-number","status":"resolved","id":"aa2f7d42f23bb3d7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-natural-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-successor-function","status":"resolved","id":"b2a81ec25c112645","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-successor-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$a,b\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{PR}_2$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。自然数加法使用 [[57-df-natural-number]] 的背景算术。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-natural-number","status":"resolved","id":"aa2f7d42f23bb3d7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$a,b\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{PR}_2$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。自然数加法使用 [[57-df-natural-number]] 的背景算术。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{add}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\mathrm{add}(a,0)\\coloneqq a,\\qquad\\mathrm{add}(a,b+1)\\coloneqq S(\\mathrm{add}(a,b)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{add}(a,b)=a+b,\\qquad\\mathrm{add}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.","display":true}],"bytes":707,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6b94974722658c7","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$a,i\\in\\mathbb N$，$s\\in\\mathbb N$ 是整个调用环境中的固定参数；$\\beta:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ 为下式定义的函数，公开接口仍只有 $a,i$ 两个参数。$\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mul},\\mathrm{div},\\mathrm{rem},\\mathrm{fact},\\pi_i^n$ 分别取 [[57-df-addition-function]]、[[57-df-multiplication-function]]、[[57-df-divrem-function]]、[[57-df-factorial-function]]、[[57-df-projection-function]]；$\\mathrm{PR}$、复合及原始递归取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]、[[57-df-composition-operator]]、[[57-df-primrec-operator]]。"},{"id":"712165bc47a6ac48","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mul},\\mathrm{PR}_2$ 取 [[57-df-addition-function]]、[[57-df-multiplication-function]]、[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。$\\dotminus$ 是下式定义的截断减法。"},{"id":"c6df01b45cb8cc59","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$a,b\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{add}$ 取 [[57-df-addition-function]]，$\\mathrm{PR}_2$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closur